.TH TARBALLEX 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
tarballex \- extract the contents of a tarball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarballex
<archive> [path]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Extracts the contents of the specified tar archive to the given path (or current directory if not specified).
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I archive
The tar archive to extract.
.TP
.I path
(Optional) Destination directory.